 "film": {
  "one_sentence": "An engineer leaves a finger-wide gap every 39 feet in his railroad while a rival races a perfectly smooth line up the same canyon, and the first to the far end wins the whole country's business.",
  "cast_notes": "The engineer (hero): thin, blue overalls with a red neckerchief, yellow hard hat, carries a brass tape measure; calm, stubborn, he checks everything twice and smiles only when a measurement is right; looks down at his work, then straight into the lens when he is sure. His crew: three men in brown, olive and rust work clothes and flat caps, always busy (one swings a sledgehammer on spikes, one carries a railroad tie on his shoulder, one pushes a wheelbarrow of gravel). The rival boss (mocker): round, black pinstripe suit, red tie, red cowboy hat, rides his own flatcar like a throne, hands on hips, always smug, never works. His crew: navy overalls, they run everywhere. The finish town: a banker in a dark suit and glasses on a mountain of money bags, a townsman in a vest and cowboy hat, a woman in a pink dress, a boy in a teal shirt; they cheer whoever arrives first.",
  "places_and_light": "A: the canyon floor, red-brown desert sand, two railroads side by side (his with visible joints and yellow gap marks, the rival's continuous and shiny), real red rock cliffs 20 m high behind, a water tower, telegraph posts, tents and a smoking campfire, cacti, sagebrush, scattered rocks, stacks of ties and rails, kegs of spikes, barrels; hard late-morning sun from the upper left, warm white, long blue-grey shadows. B: the finish town 40 m east at the canyon mouth: a wooden station with a porch, a big cloth banner on two posts, bunting, a freight wagon; the same sun, now with dust in the air.",
  "colour_meaning": "Red means his company (his locomotive cab, his flag, his gap marks are yellow on red ties); blue means the rival (cab, flag, crew).",
  "speaking_lines": "No quoted line in the first 10 seconds.",
  "extreme_gags": "\"the whole country's BUSINESS\": a mountain of money bags as tall as the station roof, the banker sitting on top of it, bags tumbling off the sides.",
  "power_moments": "\"RACING\": both locomotives blast smoke at once and the camera rides beside the blue one. \"BUSINESS\": the banner flips to THE WHOLE COUNTRY'S BUSINESS with a glow while hats fly into the air.",
  "impossible_view": "\"GAPS\": the camera sits inside the gap between two rail ends, at rail height, looking up at the engineer's face through the gap."
 },
